# App Home UI

- Entry: `app/routes/app.tsx` (iframe + AppProvider + `s-app-nav`).
- Load inbox once in the `app` layout loader (`app/inbox.server.ts`). Child pages read `useRouteLoaderData("routes/app")`.
- Polaris web components only. Toast via `useAppBridge().toast.show`.
- `s-text` subdued color is `color="subdued"`.
- Routes: `/app`, `/app/task/:id`, `/app/weekly-review`, `/app/settings`.
- English UI copy.
- Sidekick tools in `extensions/app-tools` are read-only. Point merchants at App Home to edit tasks.
